## Project Structure

```
security-network-builder/
├── src/snb/
│   ├── main.py            # CLI, pipeline, command dispatch
│   ├── doctor.py          # pre-flight checks
│   ├── config.py          # profile loading (with bundled fallback), keyword matching
│   ├── github_api.py      # read-only REST + GraphQL transport, rate-limit handling
│   ├── graphql_api.py     # batched GraphQL fetch, normalised to REST shapes
│   ├── discovery.py       # profile -> GitHub searches -> candidate engineers
│   ├── scoring.py         # explainable scoring engine
│   ├── reputation.py      # capped, hard-to-game reputation signals
│   ├── graph.py           # relationship graph, centrality, communities
│   ├── orgs.py            # organization analysis
│   ├── history.py         # SQLite run history, triage notes, run diff
│   ├── explain.py         # template + optional LLM explanations
│   ├── profile_builder.py # profile suggestion from your own repos
│   ├── dashboard.py       # hardened local HTTP server
│   ├── dashboard_page.py  # single-page UI (no external resources)
│   ├── default_profile.yaml
│   ├── models.py
│   └── report.py
├── profiles/
│   └── security_profile.yaml   # your editable copy
├── tests/
│   ├── test_*.py          # offline pytest suite
│   └── web/               # jsdom DOM test for the dashboard
├── .github/               # CI workflow, Dependabot
├── pyproject.toml
├── .env.example
└── README.md
```

